  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now putting the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now on comparing real and imaginary part, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Now solving,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>We know that quadratic equation is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mtext>sum&#160;of&#160;roots</mtext></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mtext>product&#160;of&#160;roots</mtext></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So, equation with roots&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
